<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan-Aug non-CIS aluminium export 1.75 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan-Aug non-CIS aluminium export 1.75 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia exported 1.75 million tonnes of primary aluminium to non-Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) destinations in January-August, State Customs Committee figures obtained by Reuters showed on Friday.</p>
<p>The committee did not give any comparative figures. The committe data was as follows:</p>
<p>			 METAL EXPORTS</p>
<p>			  (in tonnes)</p>
<p>		Jan-Aug    To non-CIS     To CIS</p>
<p>			    destinations   destinations</p>
<p> Aluminium  1,755,300    1,754,600	  700</p>
<p>(primary)</p>
<p> Copper	 352,900	351,400	1,500</p>
<p>(refined)</p>
<p> Nickel	 104,200	104,000	  200</p>
<p>(primary)</p>
<p>Trade with neighbouring Belarus was not included in the figures.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
